flowchart LR
  O([Operator]) --> SITE[Create, inspect, update, pause or remove site]
  O --> CHECK[Check now]
  O --> REPLAY[Replay real past scenes]
  O --> ZONE[Manage authorised zones and illustrative records]
  O --> MODEL[Inspect models, data and status]
  O --> CAND[Discover and approve preliminary catalogue candidates via API]
  R([Reviewer]) --> INCIDENT[Inspect incident, reasons and dated images]
  R --> STATUS[Acknowledge, field verification, resolve or false positive]
  R --> PDF[Download case PDF]
  R --> INBOX[Inspect department inbox and channel outcomes]
  R --> REDIS[Manually redispatch an alert]
  CHECK --> RUN[Queue monitored analysis]
  REPLAY --> RUN
  TIMER([Scheduler]) --> RUN
  RUN <-->|Catalogue and real windows| SAT([Imagery providers])
  RUN <-->|Optional corroboration| CTX([Context services])
  RUN --> ALERT[Create eligible department alert]
  ALERT --> INBOX
  ALERT --> MAIL[Optional SMTP or saved unsent email]
  REDIS --> MAIL
  O --> AUTH[Login if write password is configured]
  R --> AUTH
